{
 "as_of": "2026-10-05",
 "descriptor": "Indian-made AI servers and supercomputers",
 "lede": "India's largest home-grown maker of high-end computing systems (Tyrone), now riding sovereign-AI GPU orders. Revenue has grown 50-90% a year with steady 13-14% margins and high returns, but this is hardware assembly priced like software, and growth now needs debt and possibly new equity for working capital.",
 "market": {
  "price": 4765,
